[gd_scene load_steps=24 format=3]

; Phase 0 gray-box. Grid unit is 0.5 m and every dimension here is a multiple
; of it, so the modular kit built in P2 drops straight into this footprint.
; Interior volume: 14.0 x 3.4 x 9.0 m. Wall thickness 0.4 m.

